  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/162/luckyskyblock.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"581\" height=\"63\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是一張幸運方塊地圖，最多可供 2 名玩家一同遊玩。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這是典型的空島生存地圖，僅包含幸運方塊。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">如有錯誤，請聯繫我們。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/167/mapp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"68\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/169/map1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/173/map5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/846/168/map.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1001\"></p>",
